<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO BEAT SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO BEAT SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FERNANDO, Trinidad 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinidad and Tobago beat Sri Lanka by three wickets in their 50-overs-a-side one-day match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 226-8 (M.Attapattu 55, R.Dhanraj 4-59), Trinidad and Tobago 215-7 in 39.5 overs (S.Rragoonath 110 not out, I.Bishop 53).</p>
<p>(Trinidad were set a revised target of 215 in 41 overs because of rain).</p>
</text>
